message: If you use Positron Lab Suite, please cite it as below.
title: "Positron Lab Suite: A Comprehensive Software Suite for Integrated Positron Annihilation Spectroscopy Data Analysis"
version: "1.0.2"
date-released: "2026-09-28"
url: "https://github.com/fluidlight/pls"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fluidlight/pls"
